Scroll Animation Architecture

Use:

GSAP
ScrollTrigger
Existing Lenis smooth scrolling if already installed

Do not introduce unnecessary dependencies.

Pinning

The entire process section should be pinned.

Example concept:

ScrollTrigger.create({
  trigger: ".process-section",
  start: "top top",
  end: "+=500%",
  pin: true,
  scrub: 1
});

The total scroll distance should give enough room for each of the 5 stages.

Do not make transitions too fast.

Scroll Progress Logic

Split the scroll into five ranges.

Example:

0% ─────────── 20% → Diagnose
20% ────────── 40% → Strategize
40% ────────── 60% → Build
60% ────────── 80% → Automate
80% ───────── 100% → Scale

However, transitions should overlap slightly.

For example:

At around 18%–25%:

Diagnose UI begins reorganizing.
Text transitions.
SVG journey reaches node 02.
Strategy interface emerges.

The transitions should feel continuous.

